(TOPIC: Zero-Trust Architecture and Factual Grounding in Generative AI) Tj T*
T*
(Abstract:) Tj T*
(Modern content distribution networks require automated factual verification, brand) Tj T*
(governance, and cryptographic auditability. This report examines how zero-trust boundaries) Tj T*
